  "final_text": "New chat\nImages\nPlugins\nDeep research\nSee plans and pricing\nHelp\nSettings\nGet responses tailored to you\n\nLog in to get answers based on saved chats, plus create images and upload files.\n\nLog in\nChatGPT\nLog in\nSign up for free\nYou said:\n\nhii\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHii! \ud83d\ude0a How are you doing? What can I help you with today?\n\nYou said:\n\nhwllo my name is reo\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHello, Reo! \ud83d\ude0a Nice to meet you! How\u2019s your day going?\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats your name\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nI'm ChatGPT! \ud83d\ude04 You can call me GPT if you like.\n\nNice to meet you, Reo! \ud83d\udc4b\n\nYou said:\n\nsuper tell mee the 20 best tamil movies\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nAbsolutely, Reo! \ud83d\ude0e\ud83c\udf7f Here\u2019s my 20 best Tamil movies list, mixing classics, modern masterpieces, action, romance, comedy, and thrillers:\n\n\ud83c\udfac Nayakan (1987) \u2014 Kamal Haasan\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Anbe Sivam (2003) \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Madhavan\n\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Ratsasan (2018) \u2014 Vishnu Vishal\n\n\ud83d\udca5 Vikram (2022) \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Vijay Sethupathi, Fahadh Faasil\n\n\u2764\ufe0f 96 (2018) \u2014 Vijay Sethupathi, Trisha\n\n\ud83e\udd4a Irudhi Suttru (2016) \u2014 Madhavan, Ritika Singh\n\n\ud83d\udc51 Thevar Magan (1992) \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Sivaji Ganesan\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Maanadu (2021) \u2014 Silambarasan, S. J. Suryah\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Aaranya Kaandam (2011) \u2014 Jackie Shroff, Ravi Krishna\n\n\ud83d\ude02 Michael Madana Kama Rajan (1990) \u2014 Kamal Haasan\n\nChatGPT is AI and can make mistakes.\n\nChat with ChatGPT",
